    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "へいこうして　ならぶ　くうかんの\nはざまに　すむと　いわれている。\nしんわに　とうじょうする　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "평행으로 늘어선 공간의\n틈새에 산다고 전해진다.\n신화에 등장하는 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On dit qu’il hante une faille d’une dimension\nparallèle à la nôtre. Il apparaît dans la mythologie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Man sagt, es lebe in einem Spalt in einer\nParalleldimension. Es wird in der Mythologie erwähnt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que vive en una dimensión espacial paralela.\nAparece en la mitología.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che viva in una dimensione parallela alla\nnostra. Appare nella mitologia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It is said to live in a gap in the spatial dimension\nparallel to ours. It appears in mythology.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "並行して　並ぶ　空間の　狭間に\n住むと　言われている。\n神話に　登場する　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que vive en una dimensión espacial paralela.\nAparece en la mitología.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くうかんを　ゆがめる　のうりょくを\nもち　シンオウちほうの　しんわでは\nかみさまとして　えがかれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "공간을 뒤틀리게 하는 능력을\n가졌으며 신오지방의 신화에서는\n신으로 묘사되고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il peut modeler l’espace. Les mythes de Sinnoh en\nparlent comme d’une divinité ancienne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es hat die Macht, den Raum zu krümmen. In den\nMythen von Sinnoh erscheint es als Gottheit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene la habilidad de distorsionar el espacio. La\nmitología de Sinnoh lo describe como una deidad.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha l’abilità di distorcere lo spazio. Nella mitologia\ndella regione di Sinnoh è una divinità.",
